Subject: [PATCH] refactor(fs): link original superblock root acquisition

---
 fs/super.c          | 71 -------------------------------------------
 fs/super_lifetime.c | 73 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 73 insertions(+), 71 deletions(-)

